"><span>VIETNAM</span> <span>06/17/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Radeon™ RX 7600 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 media of Techflow\" href=\"In the hands of the graphic card ASUS ROG Strix AMD Radeon RX 7600 OC 8GB: Beautiful design, RDNA3 architecture and optimal heat dissipation ability\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Congngheviet\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1343/202009031853478380310.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      Trên tay card đồ hoạ ASUS ROG Strix AMD Radeon RX 7600 OC 8GB: Thiết kế đẹp, kiến trúc RDNA3 và khả năng tản nhiệt tối ưu\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Congngheviet\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>VIETNAM</span> <span>06/18/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Radeon™ RX 7600 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 media of Congngheviet\" href=\"https://congngheviet.com/tren-tay-card-do-hoa-asus-rog-strix-amd-radeon-rx-7600-oc-8gb/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Guru3d\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202009031814090100336.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      The STRIX design facilitates modest noise levels and manages heat effectively.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Guru3d\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>06/07/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Radeon™ RX 7600 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 media of Guru3d\" href=\"https://www.guru3d.com/articles_pages/asus_radeon_rx_7600_strix_oc_review,1.html\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ezone.com\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1272/202009251010282580214.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      Through the Built for Brilliance online conference, ASUS showed a variety of new ZenBooks for everyone. Among them, ZenBook Flip S and ZenBook S have a black gold body with a red copper diamond cut frame, which is extremely eye-catching.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      ezone.com\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>HONG KONG</span> <span>09/03/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Radeon™ RX 7600 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 media of ezone.com\" href=\"https://ezone.ulifestyle.com.hk/article/2743022/ASUS%20ZenBook%202020%20%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%97%E8%B6%85%E6%90%B6%E7%9C%BC%EF%BC%81Intel%20%E7%AC%AC%2011%20%E4%BB%A3%20Core%20Ultrabook%20%E9%AC%A5%E8%B2%B4%E6%B0%A3\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Alza.cz\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/202010270147312040683.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      The Asus STRIX RX 7600 O8G Gaming graphics card offers solid performance to all light to moderate PC gamers, especially those who use 1920 x 1080 (FHD) resolution in their games. The graphics card has a very well-engineered cooling system with two fans, which also gives it excellent operating characteristics, especially low temperatures and noise under load.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Alza.cz\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>07/17/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Radeon™ RX 7600 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 media of Alza.cz\" href=\"https://www.alza.cz/asus-strix-radeon-rx-7600-o8g-gaming-recenze-a-testy#hodnoceni-graficke-karty\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"www.diit.cz\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/202010082115592660712.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      The ASUS ROG STRIX Radeon RX 7600 O8G GAMING OC is simply a faster and quieter RX 7600 than its reference counterpart. The main advantage is the quiet operation thanks to the massive cooler, and by overclocking it is possible to squeeze out some extra performance.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      www.diit.cz\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>09/15/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Radeon™ RX 7600 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 media of www.diit.cz\" href=\"https://diit.cz/clanek/recenze-asus-rog-strix-radeon-rx-7600-o8g-gaming-oc\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"www.pctuning.cz\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/202010270153389860559.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      ROG Strix RX 7600 offers an extremely powerful cooler and high-end equipment combined with factory overclocking.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      www.pctuning.cz\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>05/25/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix Radeon™ RX 7600 OC Edition 8GB GDDR6 media of www.pctuning.cz\" href=\"https://pctuning.cz/article/asus-rog-strix-rx-7600-o8g-strix-jako-vzdy-spickova-vybava-za-cenu-ktera-netesi?chapter=18#article-header\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87